{"id":"tampoco","lemma":"tampoco","pos":"adv","rank":350,"glosses":["neither; nor; also not","either (as well, with implied negative)"],"ipa":"/tamˈpoko/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-tampoco.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tampoco lo puedo explicar.","en":"I can't explain it either.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1405","words":[null,{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to explain"}]},{"text":"Tampoco necesitaba hacer eso.","en":"I didn't need to do that either.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/435686","words":[null,{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Ella tampoco me entiende.","en":"She doesn't understand me, either.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352670","words":[{"g":"she"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to understand","l":"entender"}]},{"text":"«No puedo dormir.» «Yo tampoco.»","en":"\"I can't sleep.\" \"Me neither.\"","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642191","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to sleep"},{"g":"I"},null]},{"text":"Yo tampoco sé qué hacer.","en":"I don't know what to do either.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/354869","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"to do"}]}]}